Suggests: smartmontools, sanoid
Description: modular administration toolbox for Proxmox VE hosts
 pve-toolbox provides an interactive launcher and self-contained modules for
 backups, ZFS maintenance and replication, and storage monitoring on Proxmox
 VE hosts.
